## AI-DLC Workflow Entry Point

**CRITICAL**: For any software development request, your FIRST action is to invoke the **`aidlc-workflow`** skill.

The skill reads `aidlc-docs/aidlc-state.md` (the workflow state SSOT) and dispatches to the correct stage skill automatically. You do not need to remember which stage comes next — the coordinator handles it.

- **Workflow state SSOT**: `aidlc-docs/aidlc-state.md`
- **Per-stage skills index**: `aidlc-docs/SKILLS.md`
- **Multi-CLI fallback**: `.unicli-rules/core-workflow.md` (Cursor / Gemini CLI / Kiro / Codex)

### Skill quick-reference

| When the user says... | Invoke |
|-----------------------|--------|
| Start / begin / new feature | `aidlc-workflow` |
| Continue / resume / what's next | `aidlc-workflow` |
| Run build and test | `aidlc-workflow` → `aidlc-build-and-test` |
| Any specific stage | `aidlc-workflow` first, it dispatches |

